---
title: Upgrade Taskip Plan
sidebar:
  order: 5
---
Upgrading your Taskip plan gives you access to extra features and increased limits. Follow these steps:

Step 1: Go to Taskip and log in with your credentials.

Step 2: Go to Settings from the menu.

Step 3: Click Billing, and you’ll see your current plan details and available upgrade options.

![](image-23-1024x507.png)

Step 4: Review the available plans and their features. Click Upgrade on the plan you want.

![](image-25.png)

Step 5: Click Continue to Payment and provide your payment details.

Step 6: Click Confirm or Upgrade Plan. You’ll get a confirmation email, and new plan features will be applied immediately.
